OL,4,CLandfill company faces HMRC winding-up 
OL,5,Cpetition                               
OL,6,GThe operator of a landfill site blamed 
OL,7,Gby villagers for creating a            
OL,8,G"horrendous" smelling mountain of      
OL,9,Grubbish is facing potential closure    
OL,10,Gafter an application by HMRC.          
OL,12,FSeletia (HW) Limited, which runs       
OL,13,FHespin Wood Landfill near Carlisle, is 
OL,14,Ffacing a winding-up petition, which    
OL,15,Fcreditors can file when trying to      
OL,16,Frecover debts.                         
OL,18,FThe Insolvency and Companies List said 
OL,19,Fa hearing for the case was scheduled   
OL,20,Ffor 9 December at the Rolls Building   
OL,21,Fin London.                             
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
