OL,4,CManchester's Co-op Live evacuated      
OL,5,Cafter 'unknown substance' let off in   
OL,6,Ccrowd                                  
OL,7,GThousands of people were evacuated     
OL,8,Gfrom a concert in Manchester on Sunday 
OL,9,Gnight after an "unknown substance" was 
OL,10,Greleased into the crowd, police said.  
OL,12,FThe incident happened towards the end  
OL,13,Fof US rapper Don Toliver's show at the 
OL,14,FCo-op Live arena at about 22:00.       
OL,16,FThe North West Ambulance Service said  
OL,17,Fone person was taken to hospital for   
OL,18,Ffurther assessment while more than 50  
OL,19,Fpeople were assessed for "eye and      
OL,20,Frespiratory symptoms".                 
OL,22,                                   G2/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
