OL,4,CCampaigners question hospital's A&E    
OL,5,Cstaffing plans                         
OL,6,GCampaigners who called for the return  
OL,7,Gof a hospital's 24-hour accident and   
OL,8,Gemergency unit for a decade are        
OL,9,Gdemanding proof that new plans to make 
OL,10,Git happen are safe and will not        
OL,11,Gundermine other health services.       
OL,13,FThe A&E unit at Chorley and South      
OL,14,FRibble Hospital in Lancashire was      
OL,15,Frequired to operate on reduced hours   
OL,16,Famid concerns about staffing safety    
OL,17,Fand finances. It currently only        
OL,18,Foperates between 08:00-20:00.          
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
