OL,4,CFrom #500 grant to funding charity's   
OL,5,Cnew centre                             
OL,6,GAn entrepreneur whose career was       
OL,7,Gstarted 30 years ago with a #500 grant 
OL,8,Gis giving back to the charity which    
OL,9,Ghelped him by funding its new centre.  
OL,11,FTyre retail boss Michael Welch is      
OL,12,Fgiving his support to The King's Trust 
OL,13,Ffacility in Liverpool, which is due to 
OL,14,Fbe opened in 2027 and will be named in 
OL,15,Fhis owner.                             
OL,17,FWelch, who grew up in Liverpool and    
OL,18,FBirkenhead, said it was a "full circle 
OL,19,Fmoment" after he first approached the  
OL,20,Fcharity, then called The Prince's      
OL,21,FTrust, for support in 1996 - when he   
OL,22,Fwas 17.                           G4/4 
